</section>
</section>
<section id="S6" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">6. </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We have proposed ReactDiff, a novel diffusion model for online generation of multiple appropriate facial reactions in dyadic interactions. By introducing temporal modeling and spatio-temporal facial kinematics priors into the diffusion denoising process, we enable model to generate a set of human-like reaction samples, effectively avoiding artifacts such as jitters, abrupt transitions, and repeated segments. Experiments demonstrate ReactDiff’s superior performance in producing diverse, appropriate, and realistic reactions in response to speakers.</p>
</div>
</section>
