<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> DPM-Solver++ 2M (SDE).</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_align_center ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          initial value <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{x}_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{x}_{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, time steps <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{t_{i}\}_{i=0}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{t_{i}\}_{i=0}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, noise levels <math id="alg2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\sigma_{i}\}_{i=0}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\sigma_{i}\}_{i=0}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, score matching network <math id="alg2.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{s}_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{s}_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          Denote <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{i}\coloneqq\lambda_{t_{i}}-\lambda_{t_{i-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≔</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{i}\coloneqq\lambda_{t_{i}}-\lambda_{t_{i-1}}</annotation></semantics></math>
for <math id="alg2.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,\dots,T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,\dots,T</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{0}}\leftarrow\bm{x}_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{0}}\leftarrow\bm{x}_{T}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{1}}\leftarrow e^{-\eta h_{1}}\frac{\sigma_{t_{1}}}{\sigma_{t_{0}}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{0}}-(e^{-h_{1}-\eta h_{1}}-1)s_{\theta}(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{0}},t_{0})+\sigma_{t_{1}}\sqrt{1-e^{-2\eta h_{1}}}z_{t_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{1}}\leftarrow e^{-\eta h_{1}}\frac{\sigma_{t_{1}}}{\sigma_{t_{0}}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{0}}-(e^{-h_{1}-\eta h_{1}}-1)s_{\theta}(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{0}},t_{0})+\sigma_{t_{1}}\sqrt{1-e^{-2\eta h_{1}}}z_{t_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\leftarrow 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\leftarrow 2</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg2.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}\leftarrow\frac{h_{i-1}}{h_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}\leftarrow\frac{h_{i-1}}{h_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{D}_{i}\leftarrow\left(1+\frac{1}{2r_{i}}\right)s_{\theta}(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{i-1}},t_{i-1})-\frac{s_{\theta}(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{i-2}},t_{i-2})}{2r_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝑫</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{D}_{i}\leftarrow\left(1+\frac{1}{2r_{i}}\right)s_{\theta}(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{i-1}},t_{i-1})-\frac{s_{\theta}(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{i-2}},t_{i-2})}{2r_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{N}_{i}\leftarrow\sigma_{t_{i}}\sqrt{1-e^{-2\eta h_{i}}}z_{t_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝑵</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{N}_{i}\leftarrow\sigma_{t_{i}}\sqrt{1-e^{-2\eta h_{i}}}z_{t_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{i}}\leftarrow e^{-\eta h_{i}}\frac{\sigma_{t_{i}}}{\sigma_{t_{i-1}}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i-1}-(e^{(-h_{i}-\eta h_{i})}-1)\bm{D}_{i}+\bm{N}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝑫</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝑵</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{i}}\leftarrow e^{-\eta h_{i}}\frac{\sigma_{t_{i}}}{\sigma_{t_{i-1}}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i-1}-(e^{(-h_{i}-\eta h_{i})}-1)\bm{D}_{i}+\bm{N}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{T}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{x}}_{t_{T}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">where the variable <math id="A2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{t}=\text{log}(\alpha_{t}/\sigma_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>log</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{t}=\text{log}(\alpha_{t}/\sigma_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> signifies the logarithm of the Signal-to-Noise Ratio (SNR) and is a strictly decreasing function of <math id="A2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, the noise term <math id="A2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z_{t_{i}}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathrm{0},\mathrm{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z_{t_{i}}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathrm{0},\mathrm{I})</annotation></semantics></math> follows a Gaussian distribution with zero mean and identity covariance. Here, <math id="A2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the mean and <math id="A2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> represents the standard deviation of the noise distribution at level <math id="A2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>. For a comprehensive understanding of these concepts and details, please refer to the work by Lu et al. <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib24" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lu et al., 2022</a>)</cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Upon comparing the characteristics of two algorithms, it becomes apparent that the SDE solver incorporates an additional component, denoted as <math id="A2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{N}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝑵</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{N}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, which includes stochastic factors in the reverse-time diffusion process. This augmentation presents a notable distinction between the methodologies under consideration.</p>
</div>
